{"last_link_id": 101, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#1f1f48", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 85, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy cleanGpuUsed", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [295.31390380859375, 26], "pos": [-725.32568359375, 2038.220703125], "id": 51, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "e07b8cc7bfb0dca03da5ac363ad73f717ffa7738", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy cleanGpuUsed"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [84, 85, 87], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [492.14044189453125, 277], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-1969.7216796875, 1291.7647705078125], "widgets_values": ["Descriptive", "long", 512, 0.9, 0, 0.6, ""], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 89, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "link": 90, "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "extra_options", "link": 91, "label": "extra_options", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_options"}, {"widget": {"name": "user_prompt"}, "name": "user_prompt", "link": 92, "label": "user_prompt", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 58, "type": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#872639", "widgets_values": ["JoyCaption Beta One 提供多种生成模式，以满足不同的需求，Descriptive Caption 和 Straightforward 是最有用的，其他模式很有趣，但不太稳定。\n\n我们一起来了解下：\n\nDescriptive Caption 以正式或随意的语气为图像编写描述性标题\nStraightforward Caption 比 Descriptive 更简洁、客观的风格。\nStable Diffusion Prompt 尝试模仿用户通常编写 Stable Diffusion 提示的方式，混合使用自然语言和类似 booru 的标签。\nMidJourney 类似于 Training Prompt 模式，但更像 MidJourney 提示。\nDanbooru tag list 写入镜像的 Danbooru 标签列表。\ne621 tag list 写入镜像的 e621 标签列表。\nRule34 tag list 写入镜像的 Rule34 标签列表。\nBooru-Like Tag List 类似于 Booru Tag List 模式，但会在 boorus 使用的严格标签列表之外写入。\nArt Critic Analysis 像艺术评论家一样撰写图像分析。\nProduct Listing 为图像编写 Product Listing 样式的标题。\nSocial Media Post 为图片撰写适合社交媒体帖子的标题。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#731225", "size": [503.553466796875, 331.3675231933594], "pos": [-1889.3280029296875, 1710.3736572265625], "id": 59, "properties": {}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [95], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [476.11578369140625, 802.3982543945312], "pos": [-4301.2666015625, 1734.09033203125], "widgets_values": ["4dc5188b9d2572d3e1a6ad07e73ad0a4d162eef30d880106b5448ca7e022ef63.png", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 55, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.34", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [92], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 340], "pos": [-2413.88525390625, 1632.37060546875], "widgets_values": ["auto", "english", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "这是一个CG游戏风格，UE5场景，国漫，纯灰色背景，虚化背景", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#1d7085", "widgets_values": ["如果图像中有人物/角色，则必须将其称为 {name}。\n不要包含有关无法更改的人物/角色的信息（如种族、性别等），但仍要包含可更改的属性（如发型）。\n包括有关照明的信息。\n包括有关摄像机角度的信息。\n包括有关是否有水印的信息。\n包括有关是否存在 JPEG 伪影的信息。\n如果是照片，您必须包含有关可能使用的相机以及光圈、快门速度、ISO 等详细信息的信息。\n不要包含任何性内容;保持 PG。\n不要提及图像的分辨率。\n您必须包含有关图像的主观审美质量的信息，从低到非常高。\n包括有关图像构图样式的信息，如引导线、三分法或对称性。\n请勿提及图像中的任何文本。\n指定景深以及背景是聚焦还是模糊。\n如果适用，请提及可能使用人工或自然光源。\n不要使用任何模棱两可的语言。\n包括图像是 sfw、suggestive 还是 nsfw。\n仅描述图像中最重要的元素。\n如果是艺术作品，请勿包含艺术家的姓名或作品名称。\n确定图像方向（纵向、横向或正方形）和纵横比（如果很明显）。\n使用粗俗的俚语和亵渎性语言，例如（但不限于）“fucking”、“slut”、“cock”等。\n不要使用礼貌的委婉语——倾向于使用直率、随意的措辞。\n包括有关任何人物/角色年龄的信息（如果适用）。\n说明图像是否描绘了极度特写、特写、中特写、中景、牛仔、中广角、广角或极广角。\n不要提及图像的情绪/感觉/等。\n明确指定有利位置高度（视线水平、低角度虫眼、鸟瞰、无人机、屋顶等）。\n如果有水印，一定要提。\n您的响应将被文本到图像模型使用，因此请避免使用无用的元短语，例如“此图像显示...”、“您正在查看...”等。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#095c71", "size": [700.4195556640625, 487.9577941894531], "pos": [-3897.28955078125, 1184.113525390625], "id": 56, "properties": {}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "joycaption_beta1_model", "links": [90], "label": "joycaption_beta1_model", "type": "JOYCAPTIONBETA1_MODEL", "localized_name": "joycaption_beta1_model"}], "size": [496.2208251953125, 118.81717681884766], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-2760.79931640625, 1049.6610107421875], "widgets_values": ["fancyfeast/llama-joycaption-beta-one-hf-llava", "nf4", "cuda"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 61, "type": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: LoadJoyCaptionBeta1Model"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [88], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 340], "pos": [-822.2306518554688, 1437.301513671875], "widgets_values": ["auto", "chinese (simplified)", false, "", "", "GoogleTranslator", "", "proxy_hide", "authorization_hide"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 87, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 53, "type": "DeepTranslatorTextNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_custom_nodes_alekpet", "ver": "fb24ee9ddb2ad0e13760ee8322ed4abdc678abcd", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "DeepTranslatorTextNode"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [432.19781494140625, 437.0179138183594], "pos": [-1327.4771728515625, 1014.1746826171875], "widgets_values": ["This is a colorful, traditional Chinese-style illustration depicting a large, bearded man in ornate, floral-patterned robes, holding a tray with a teapot and fish, and reading a book. He wears a black and red hat adorned with flowers. Surrounding him are three young children dressed in blue and red traditional attire, with one child standing on his right and two on his left. The background features a blue sky with fluffy white clouds, and a border of pink and yellow flowers at the bottom. Chinese characters are written vertically on the left. The overall style is whimsical and festive.", "This is a digital artwork in a realistic, fantasy style, likely inspired by Chinese comics and created using Unreal Engine 5 (UE5). The central figure is a young Asian woman with a fair complexion, standing in a dynamic, slightly ethereal pose. She has long, flowing black hair that is partially tied up and cascades down her back, moving with a sense of wind. Her expression is calm and focused, with slightly closed eyes and a subtle, serene smile.\n\nShe is dressed in a traditional Chinese-style kimono, which is a deep teal color with wide sleeves and a white inner lining that peeks out at the neckline. The kimono is tied with a dark, textured obi belt around her waist. In her right hand, she holds a sleek, silver katana with a sharp, reflective blade, the hilt of which is simple and dark.\n\nThe background is a blurred, monochromatic gray, with swirling clouds and mist that give the scene an otherworldly, misty atmosphere. The light source appears to be soft and diffused, adding to the ethereal quality of the image. The overall composition is balanced, with the character centered and the background providing a sense of movement and depth."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 84, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 50, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [89, 101], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "原始大小", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "links": [], "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "links": [], "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [263.3652648925781, 333.3173522949219], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-3306.27490234375, 1874.3031005859375], "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "letterbox", "lanczos", "8", "longest", 1280, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 95, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_layerstyle", "ver": "a46b1e6d26d45be9784c49f7065ba44700ef2b63", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: ImageScaleByAspectRatio V2"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [315, 270], "pos": [-2244.774169921875, 2290.65185546875], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI", ""], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 101, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}], "flags": {}, "id": 62, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [308.04949951171875, 331.0021057128906], "pos": [-3742.615966796875, 1921.0736083984375], "widgets_values": ["这是一个五颜六色的中国风格的插图，描绘了一个穿着华丽的花卉图案长袍的大胡子男人，拿着带有茶壶和鱼的托盘，并读了一本书。他戴着一顶鲜花装饰的黑色和红色帽子。周围是三个穿着蓝色和红色传统服装的小孩，一个孩子站在他的右边，左边有两个孩子。背景具有蓝天，蓬松的白色云层，底部有粉红色和黄色花的边界。汉字在左边垂直写。整体风格是异想天开和节日的。", "这是一种以现实，幻想风格的数字艺术作品，可能是受中国漫画启发的，并使用虚幻引擎5（UE5）创建。中心人物是一位年轻的亚洲女性，肤色合理，站在一个充满活力的略微空灵的姿势中。她有长长的黑发，部分被绑起来，并沿着她的背部沿着她的背部沿着她的背部。她的表情平静而专注，眼睛略微闭着，微妙而宁静的微笑。\n\n她穿着传统的中式和服，是一种深蓝绿色，带有宽阔的袖子和白色的内衬，可在领口窥视。和服绑在她腰部的黑暗，纹理的obi皮带上。她用右手握着一个时尚的银色武士刀，上面有一个锋利的反光刀片，其刀柄简单而黑暗。\n\n背景是一种模糊，单色的灰色，上面有旋转的云层和雾气，使场景具有超凡脱俗的雾气。光源似乎柔软且扩散，增加了图像的空灵质量。整体构图是平衡的，角色中心和背景提供了运动和深度感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 88, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 54, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "extra_option", "links": [91], "label": "extra_option", "type": "JoyCaption2ExtraOption", "localized_name": "extra_option"}], "size": [470.3999938964844, 706], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-2915.7900390625, 1297.0750732421875], "widgets_values": [false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, false, "wangdapao"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 57, "type": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: JoyCaptionBeta1ExtraOptions"}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offse